OL,3,CJesy Nelson in a 'dream' after twin
OL,4,Cdaughters have feeding tubes removed
OL,6,FJesy Nelson has said she is in a
OL,7,F"dream" after her daughters underwent
OL,8,Fan operation to have their nasogastric
OL,9,Ffeeding tubes removed.
OL,11,FThe Little Mix star's daughters, Ocean
OL,12,FJade and Story Monroe, have both been
OL,13,Fdiagnosed with spinal muscular atrophy
OL,14,F(SMA), a rare condition that causes
OL,15,Fmuscle weakness.
OL,17,FThe condition requires them to be
OL,18,Fgiven feeding support as part of their
OL,19,Fearly medical care, but they had their
OL,20,Ftubes removed on Friday.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@GO]
