OL,3,CJesy Nelson in a 'dream' after twin
OL,4,Cdaughters have feeding tubes removed
OL,6,FFollowing the surgery, Nelson shared a
OL,7,Fseries of photos of her daughters in
OL,8,Fhospital beds, captioning one post: "I
OL,9,Fgot their face back feels like a
OL,10,Fdream."
OL,12,FAnother showed her twins sleeping in
OL,13,Fbeds next to each other, with Nelson
OL,14,Falso posting a photo holding a hair
OL,15,Fclip that read "good things are
OL,16,Fcoming".
OL,26,@pD@eOUrD@GO]wD@POUxD@GO]
