OL,3,CJesy Nelson in a 'dream' after twin
OL,4,Cdaughters have feeding tubes removed
OL,6,FNelson, who had her twins with former
OL,7,Fpartner Zion Foster, posted a video of
OL,8,Fherself in hospital with Ocean and
OL,9,FStory before the procedure to remove
OL,10,Fthe tubes.
OL,12,FCaressing her daughter's face, she
OL,13,Fsaid: "Today is the big day. We're
OL,14,Ftaking these plasters off, aren't we?
OL,15,FNo more tubey for you in your face."
OL,17,FAddressing her social media followers,
OL,18,Fshe added: "They're going down soon.
OL,19,FThe bravest girls in all of the world."
OL,26,@uD@GOUwD@dO]zD@LOU{D@gO]
