OL,3,CJesy Nelson in a 'dream' after twin
OL,4,Cdaughters have feeding tubes removed
OL,6,FOn Thursday, the singer shared a photo
OL,7,Fof her twins and said it was the last
OL,8,Fday they would use the feeding tubes.
OL,10,FShe wrote: "Today is the last day of
OL,11,Fmy baby girls having their tubes on
OL,12,Ftheir faces.
OL,14,F"As terrified as I am about them
OL,15,Fhaving their operation tomorrow, I
OL,16,Fcannot wait to finally see their faces
OL,17,Fagain and see their little dimples
OL,18,Fthat are always hidden under these
OL,19,Fplasters.
OL,26,@rD@LOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
