OL,3,CJesy Nelson in a 'dream' after twin
OL,4,Cdaughters have feeding tubes removed
OL,6,FAccording to the NHS, SMA can cause
OL,7,Fmuscle weakness, difficulty sitting
OL,8,Fup, crawling or walking, problems
OL,9,Fbreathing or swallowing, and bone and
OL,10,Fjoint issues.
OL,12,FNelson's twins have Type 1 SMA, which
OL,13,Fbegins in babies under six months old.
OL,15,FThe popstar revealed that her
OL,16,Fdaughters had the rare genetic
OL,17,Fcondition in January, saying they are
OL,18,Funlikely to be able to walk or gain
OL,19,Fneck strength.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
