OL,3,CJesy Nelson in a 'dream' after twin
OL,4,Cdaughters have feeding tubes removed
OL,6,FSince the twins' diagnosis, Nelson had
OL,7,Fbeen campaigning for the condition to
OL,8,Fbe added to the newborn blood spot
OL,9,Fscreening test as early treatment can
OL,10,Fhelp avoid some of its most
OL,11,Fdevastating effects.
OL,13,FThe Department of Health announced in
OL,14,FJuly that the national newborn
OL,15,Fscreening programme for SMA will be
OL,16,Frolled out across England as part of
OL,17,Fan evaluation programme from the end
OL,18,Fof this year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
